
This folder contains input file, grid file, mass matrix file, stiffness matrix file
for the Riggs Wigley hull case at Bow in the Journal paper 
'Solving for hydroelastic ship response using Timoshenko beam modes at forward speed'

Note that please select the Euler-Bernoulli beam and Newman hydrostatic model inside the codes, 'OW3DConstants.cpp'.


In the paper, only 'double body' base flow has been used, so just set 'db' in the 'base' line in ow3d.in file.

Three froude number have been applied for this case, i.e., 
Froude number = 0.1, 0.2 0.3, please set 'sped:' = '3.132', '6.264', '9.4' respectivelty in the 'sped' line in ow3d.in file.

